  "prefLabel": "En 1015.02 Utility Website Posting",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1015.02 Utility Website Posting. Each utility shall post this chapter to a well-identified page within the utility’s website. The relevant website page shall include:\n\n(a) This chapter in an electronically searchable format;\n\n(b) The utility’s standard forms; and\n\n(c) The utility’s point of contact for submission of applications including email address and phone number.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en1000.html"
